; R11 OBS logcat audit48943 at GNSS probe startup: hal_gnss_default denied
; setattr on its own pipefs fifo_file. Also present in vectors-r11.json.
; SRC Service::start in gnss-hal/service.cpp checks fchmod(command[0],0600)
; after creating the nonblocking UTC-command pipe; failure closes descriptors
; and returns EX_ILLEGAL_STATE before posix_spawn. The LOC child's time-fd
; check requires root0600. Preserve that check and the pipe's private mode.
; Round6 already allowed create/read/write/open/getattr/ioctl on this same-SID
; anonymous pipe. Complete only its missing mode-change permission.
(allow hal_gnss_default self (fifo_file (setattr)))

; R11 glass regression: old composer xperms admitted GETRESOURCES (64a0)
; and steady-state import/atomic/vblank/RMFB, but omitted startup discovery.
; SRC AOSP drm_hwcomposer DrmDevice::Init requires SET_CLIENT_CAP before it
; accepts a DRM device, then master/capability, connector/CRTC/plane/property
; discovery and mode blobs. libdrm drmIsMaster uses AUTH_MAGIC with token0.
; Its initial black modeset buffer also needs dumb-buffer/PRIME/ADDFB2 calls.
; Complete those DRM operations for the existing composer->graphics_device
; pair only. No GPU-private ioctl range, new node label, DAC change, gate
; write or domain permissive. Boot log rings missed the first failing call;
; the policy/startup mismatch is source-proven, glass qualification pending.
; VERSION, GEM_CLOSE, GET_CAP, SET_CLIENT_CAP, AUTH_MAGIC, SET/DROP_MASTER,
; PRIME_HANDLE_TO_FD, GETCRTC, GETENCODER, GETCONNECTOR, GET/SET_PROPERTY,
; GETPROPBLOB, CREATE/MAP/DESTROY_DUMB, GETPLANERESOURCES/GETPLANE, ADDFB2,
; OBJ_GET/SET_PROPERTIES, CREATE/DESTROY_PROPBLOB.
(allowx hal_graphics_composer_default graphics_device_202504 (ioctl chr_file (0x6400 0x6409 0x640c 0x640d 0x6411 0x641e 0x641f 0x642d 0x64a1 0x64a6 0x64a7 0x64aa 0x64ab 0x64ac 0x64b2 0x64b3 0x64b4 0x64b5 0x64b6 0x64b8 0x64b9 0x64ba 0x64bd 0x64be)))
